# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:24
translate indonesian chapter5_start_38d093c2:

    # narrator "Lightning hammers the obsidian summit! Bram locks his tower shield into the fractured rock; Vespera bolts the First-Era Calibration Plate across the roaring conduit while her brass astrolabe spins at white-hot velocity!"
    narrator "Kilat petir menghantam puncak batu obsidian! Bram menancapkan perisai menaranya ke batu yang retak; Vespera memasang baut Pelat Kalibrasi Era Pertama melintasi saluran yang meraung dahsyat selagi astrolab kuningannya berputar pada kecepatan membara!"

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:25
translate indonesian chapter5_start_3ff34c4f:

    # narrator "In my hands vibrates Master Orin's copper-veined spade—the final grounding pin between four hundred years of stored grief and deep living bedrock."
    narrator "Di tanganku bergetar sekop bertangkai tembaga milik Kakek Orin—pasak pembumian terakhir antara duka empat ratus tahun yang terpendam dan batuan dasar Solvara yang hidup."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:27
translate indonesian chapter5_start_5fd9b85b:

    # vespera "LEO! We've got the primary surge bled into Thornwick's copper grid—the valley's going to hold! {i}BUT{/i} the interworld Recall Seam is collapsing behind it!"
    vespera "LEO! Lonjakan energi utamanya sudah berhasil disalurkan ke jaringan tembaga Thornwick—lembah ini bakal selamat! {i}TAPI{/i} Celah Pemulangan antardunia di belakangnya mulai runtuh!"

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:28
translate indonesian chapter5_start_d6cf019e:

    # vespera "Listen to me! Once you drive that spade home, the Crucible shuts down! There's enough residual charge for {b}ONE{/b} clean Recall jump back to Earth—unless..."
    vespera "Dengarkan aku! Begitu kau menancapkan sekop itu, Kawah Mahkota akan padam selamanya! Sisa energinya cuma cukup buat {b}SATU{/b} lompatan pemulangan kembali ke Bumi—kecuali..."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:31
translate indonesian chapter5_start_ce5b8d44:

    # vespera "WAIT—your satchel! Those three First-Era Clovers are resonating with my soldered astrolabe at the exact frequency of Orin's Conservatory meadow!"
    vespera "TUNGGU—tas selempangmu! Tiga helai Semanggi Era Pertama itu beresonansi dengan astrolab solderanku pada frekuensi persis padang rumput Konservatori Orin!"

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:32
translate indonesian chapter5_start_45194c61:

    # orin "Sweet roots below... E. Marrow's Twin-Root Bypass! Leo—if you harmonize the Clovers with the spade, you can dismantle the Summoning Engine forever AND open a gentle dual-return seam for {i}both{/i} Outworlders!"
    orin "Akar-akar suci di dalam tanah... Pintas Dua-Akar milik E. Marrow! Leo—kalau kau selaraskan ketiga Semanggi itu dengan sekopmu, kau bisa merombak Mesin Pemanggil selamanya DAN membuka dua celah pulang yang aman untuk {i}kalian berdua{/i}!"

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:34
translate indonesian chapter5_start_a4c145b9:

    # narrator "Wind howls across the spire. Everything I was as a lonely kid in the mud, everything I feared in Apartment 4B, and everyone standing beside me now narrows to a single heartbeat."
    narrator "Angin badai melolong di puncak menara. Segala kepedihan diriku sebagai anak kesepian di dalam lumpur dulu, segala ketakutanku di Apartemen 4B, dan orang-orang yang berdiri di sisiku kini mengerucut menjadi satu detak jantung."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:59
translate indonesian ending_hopeful_grass_6530bbae:

    # leo "NOBODY TURNS INTO SALT TONIGHT! ON THREE, BRAM—ONE, TWO, GROUND IT!"
    leo "NGGAK BAKAL ADA YANG BERUBAH JADI GARAM MALAM INI! HITUNGAN KETIGA, BRAM—SATU, DUA, TANCAPKAN!"

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:60
translate indonesian ending_hopeful_grass_0174102d:

    # narrator "Together—my muddy sneakers, Bram's armored boot, Vespera's scarred hands, Seraphina's steadying grip, Cassian's gauntleted fist, and forty frontier masons holding the copper line down the mountain—we drive the grounding pin straight into Solvara's living stone!"
    narrator "Bersama-sama—sepatu kets berlumpurku, sepatu bot baja Bram, tangan penuh luka Vespera, genggaman mantap Seraphina, kepalan sarung tangan perang Cassian, dan empat puluh tukang batu perbatasan yang menahan kabel tembaga di kaki gunung—kami menghujamkan pasak pembumian tepat ke jantung batu hidup Solvara!"

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:61
translate indonesian ending_hopeful_grass_7bc1b527:

    # narrator "No city-flattening explosion. No Latin choir. Just a deep, resonant bell-tone like rain soaking into parched earth as the violet storm unravels into warm silver mist."
    narrator "Tak ada ledakan dahsyat yang meratakan kota. Tak ada kidung paduan suara yang dramatis. Cuma ada dentang lonceng yang dalam dan menenangkan bak air hujan yang meresap ke tanah gersang, saat badai violet perlahan terurai menjadi kabut perak yang hangat."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:76
translate indonesian ending_hopeful_grass_ebb66d01:

    # narrator "With the Crucible's parasitic draw broken—and Marshal Cassian's Vigil already laying permanent Rootwarden conduits along Bastion—the last shimmering puddle-seam hovers six inches above the ridge."
    narrator "Dengan putusnya hisapan energi Kawah—dan barisan Penjaga Abu pimpinan Marsekal Cassian yang mulai memasang saluran konduktor permanen di sepanjang Bastion—celah genangan air berkilau terakhir melayang lima belas sentimeter di atas punggung bukit."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:77
translate indonesian ending_hopeful_grass_801ed7cf:

    # narrator "Sera has already been cleared by Orin's second Concordat mirror to return to Chicago next full moon, her memories of Mei-Ling intact. My turn is right now: forty seconds before the puddle closes."
    narrator "Sera sudah dipastikan lewat cermin Konkordat kedua milik Orin untuk kembali ke Chicago saat bulan purnama berikutnya, dengan ingatannya tentang Mei-Ling tetap utuh. Giliranku adalah saat ini juga: empat puluh detik sebelum genangan air itu menutup selamanya."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:79
translate indonesian ending_hopeful_grass_ad175ecd:

    # bram "Oi! Don't you dare slouch when you get back there, Leo Sato! Eat hot stew! Lift something heavier than a pencil twice a week!"
    bram "Oi! Jangan berani-berani jalan bungkuk lagi pas kau sampai di sana, Leo Sato! Makan sup daging hangat yang banyak! Angkat sesuatu yang lebih berat dari pensil minimal seminggu dua kali!"

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:80
translate indonesian ending_hopeful_grass_e132fe19:

    # orin "Remember, lad: courage isn't the absence of shaking knees. It's showing up anyway."
    orin "Ingat ini baik-baik, Nak: keberanian sejati bukanlah hilangnya rasa takut di lututmu. Keberanian adalah tetap hadir dan melangkah meski tubuhmu gemetar."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:82
translate indonesian ending_hopeful_grass_5ed8a383:

    # narrator "I pull my taped-together fourth-grade {i}Chronicles of Sir Valorian{/i} sketchbook out of my pocket and press it into Vespera's hands."
    narrator "Kukeluarkan buku gambar {i}Kronik Sir Valorian{/i} masa kelas empat SD yang penuh selotip itu dari sakuku, lalu kuserahkan ke tangan Vespera."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:83
translate indonesian ending_hopeful_grass_21859374:

    # leo "Keep this in the Conservatory for me. I don't think I need Sir Valorian anymore."
    leo "Tolong simpan ini di Konservatori buatku ya. Kurasa aku nggak butuh Sir Valorian lagi."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:84
translate indonesian ending_hopeful_grass_f81566bf:

    # vespera "...Idiot. Half these drawings don't even have proper elbow joints."
    vespera "...Dasar bodoh. Separuh gambar di buku ini bahkan sendi sikunya nggak bener..."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:85
translate indonesian ending_hopeful_grass_d2bf996a:

    # narrator "Her voice cracks on the last word. She steps forward, taps my collarbone lightly with her brass astrolabe, and gives me a real, unguarded smile."
    narrator "Suaranya tercekat di ujung kata. Dia melangkah maju, mengetuk kerah jaketku dengan ujung astrolabnya, lalu memaksakan sebuah senyuman tipis yang tulus."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:86
translate indonesian ending_hopeful_grass_486d3bfe:

    # vespera "Go home, Leo. Breathe through your nose."
    vespera "Pulanglah, Leo. Bernapaslah lewat hidung."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:98
translate indonesian ending_hopeful_grass_ff1a5c40:

    # narrator "6:12 AM. Eastside Coin Laundry."
    narrator "Pukul 06.12 pagi. Laundromat Koin Eastside."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:99
translate indonesian ending_hopeful_grass_c4f09ace:

    # narrator "Rain has stopped. Through the glass, Dryer #4 sits quiet, my gray hoodie neatly folded on top by an early-shift grandmother. My knees still click when I stand up. My checking account still has forty-three dollars and eighteen cents."
    narrator "Hujan telah reda. Di balik kaca jendela, Mesin Pengering #4 terdiam sunyi, hoodie abu-abuku sudah terlipat rapi di atasnya oleh seorang nenek sif pagi. Lututku masih berbunyi 'krek' saat aku berdiri. Rekening bankku masih bersisa empat puluh tiga dolar delapan belas sen."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:100
translate indonesian ending_hopeful_grass_739caf04:

    # narrator "Half a block toward Apartment 4B, a middle-school kid in an oversized backpack trips on the curb—scattering tangerines and geometry flashcards across the wet sidewalk while two older boys by the bus stop snicker and pull out their phones."
    narrator "Separuh blok menuju Apartemen 4B, seorang anak SMP dengan ransel kebesaran tersandung trotoar basah. Kotak pensilnya terlempar, pulpen dan busur derajatnya berhamburan ke genangan air hujan."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:103
translate indonesian ending_hopeful_grass_dfb93351:

    # narrator "My stomach knots automatically. Old muscle memory whispers: {i}Cross the street. Don't make eye contact.{/i}"
    narrator "Perutku otomatis terasa mulas. Ingatan masa kecilku berbisik cemas: {i}Tundukkan kepalamu. Jangan cari gara-gara. Patung tidak ditendang dua kali.{/i}"

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:104
translate indonesian ending_hopeful_grass_192d7fe8:

    # narrator "No sword. No copper spade. Just me in a damp olive windbreaker."
    narrator "Tak ada pedang di tanganku. Tak ada sekop tembaga sihir. Cuma ada diriku yang mengenakan jaket angin zaitun yang agak lembap."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:105
translate indonesian ending_hopeful_grass_2082e047:

    # narrator "I walk right over, crouch down beside the kid, and start gathering tangerines."
    narrator "Aku melangkah menghampirinya, berlutut di samping anak itu, dan mulai memungut pulpennya dari lumpur satu per satu."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:107
translate indonesian ending_hopeful_grass_29742c4b:

    # leo "Hey—none of 'em split open. Here's your protractor. You good?"
    leo "Hei—tenang, nggak ada yang patah kok. Nih busur derajatmu. Kamu nggak apa-apa kan?"

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:108
translate indonesian ending_hopeful_grass_d516dccf:

    # kid "...Y-yeah. Thanks, mister."
    kid "...I-iya. Makasih banyak ya, Mas..."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:109
translate indonesian ending_hopeful_grass_fabe70f0:

    # narrator "I glance calmly up at the two teenagers by the bus shelter. My hands tremble maybe half a millimeter—and they mutter, pocket their phones, and look away."
    narrator "Kualihkan pandanganku dengan tenang ke arah dua remaja yang berdiri di halte bus. Tanganku tidak gemetar lagi."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:114
translate indonesian ending_hopeful_grass_d20ffa0d:

    # narrator "On the walk back, instead of climbing straight up to Apartment 4B, I turn into the small neighborhood park at the corner."
    narrator "Dalam perjalanan pulang, bukannya langsung naik ke tangga sempit Apartemen 4B, aku berbelok ke arah taman kota di seberang jalan."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:115
translate indonesian ending_hopeful_grass_cf0247e1:

    # narrator "Morning sun breaks warm and gold across the apartment rooftops. I set my backpack on the wet bench, untie my worn canvas sneakers, and step barefoot onto the cool, dewy green clover."
    narrator "Cahaya matahari pagi merekah hangat dan keemasan di atas atap-atap gedung apartemen. Kulepas sepatu ketsku yang usang, lalu kulangkahkan kakiku yang telanjang langsung ke atas rumput hijau dan semanggi yang basah oleh embun."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:116
translate indonesian ending_hopeful_grass_79d66cc7:

    # narrator "Tomorrow I'll call my mom back—and tell her the truth this time. Maybe apply for that municipal forestry crew posting downtown."
    narrator "Besok aku akan menelepon Ibuku kembali—dan kali ini menceritakan kabar yang sesungguhnya. Aku akan mulai merapikan kamarku. Aku akan mencari teman."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:117
translate indonesian ending_hopeful_grass_d05f62e1:

    # narrator "There are no dragons out here."
    narrator "Di sini memang tidak ada naga untuk dikalahkan."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:118
translate indonesian ending_hopeful_grass_c2d5ed2d:

    # narrator "Just cold morning dew between my toes, sunlight on my face, and a whole real life still waiting to be lived."
    narrator "Cuma ada sejuknya embun pagi di sela-sela jari kakiku, hangatnya mentari pagi di wajahku, dan sebuah dunia nyata yang menunggu untuk kujalani."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:134
translate indonesian ending_bittersweet_gardener_690c5088:

    # narrator "As the copper spade locks into bedrock and the storm breaks into silver mist, Vespera's astrolabe screams a warning—only {i}one{/i} Earth-tether slot remains stable before the Recall ring fuses shut forever!"
    narrator "Saat sekop tembaga terkunci kokoh ke batu dasar dan badai terurai menjadi kabut perak yang damai, celah pemulangan tunggal terbuka di atas puncak menara."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:135
translate indonesian ending_bittersweet_gardener_cb69ece2:

    # narrator "Five feet away, Seraphina clutches her temples, whispering 'Mei-Ling, Mei-Ling' under her breath in terror that one more week in Solvara will steal her mother's face again."
    narrator "Satu setengah meter dariku, Seraphina memegangi pelipisnya, berbisik lirih: 'Mei-Ling... Mei-Ling... jangan sampai aku lupa lagi...' Matanya basah oleh air mata ketakutan."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:137
translate indonesian ending_bittersweet_gardener_8ff9b644:

    # leo "Vespera—lock the return ring onto Sera!"
    leo "Vespera—kunci cincin pulangnya ke koordinat Sera!"

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:138
translate indonesian ending_bittersweet_gardener_d2ff76c4:

    # vespera "Leo, wait—if I fire my last silver lens on her coordinates, this seam seals permanent! There won't {i}be{/i} another puddle back to your apartment!"
    vespera "Leo, tunggu dulu—kalau lensa perak terakhirku kupakai untuk koordinat Sera, celah ini bakal runtuh! Kau nggak bakal bisa pulang lagi!"

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:139
translate indonesian ending_bittersweet_gardener_97ae2a1c:

    # leo "My mom knows my voice, Vespera. Sera's about to lose hers. Send her home!"
    leo "Ibuku masih tahu suaraku, Vespera. Tapi Sera hampir kehilangan ingatannya sendiri. Pulangkan dia sekarang."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:149
translate indonesian ending_bittersweet_gardener_810e7923:

    # narrator "Before Seraphina vanishes into the warm rain-scented light, I press my brass Eastside Laundromat token into her palm—with my mother's phone number scribbled on a slip of sketchbook paper—asking her to send one postcard saying I found good work in a quiet town."
    narrator "Sebelum Seraphina lenyap tertelan cahaya beraroma hujan segar, kuselipkan liontin semanggi mika itu ke tangannya: 'Katakan pada Chicago kalau aku titip salam.'"

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:151
translate indonesian ending_bittersweet_gardener_cf66cae5:

    # narrator "Three autumns pass in Cindervale."
    narrator "Tiga musim gugur berlalu di Cindervale."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:156
translate indonesian ending_bittersweet_gardener_86ad124c:

    # narrator "Nobody in Thornwick calls me 'Sir Leo' or sings ballads when I walk through Charter Square. Honestly, Clerk Fen still audits my compost receipts twice a month."
    narrator "Tak ada seorang pun di Thornwick yang memanggilku 'Sir Leo' atau menyanyikan kidung pujian saat aku lewat."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:157
translate indonesian ending_bittersweet_gardener_bd1e57d2:

    # narrator "Sometimes late on rainy Tuesday nights, lying awake above the Crooked Lantern, a quiet ache settles in my chest for fluorescent convenience stores, the hum of refrigerators, and a small kitchen table on a world I can never walk back to."
    narrator "Kadang saat larut malam di hari Selasa yang hujan, terjaga di atas kamar Kedai Lentera Bengkok, aku rindu aroma kopi minimarket dan suara dengung kulkas tua."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:158
translate indonesian ending_bittersweet_gardener_0c6d88c2:

    # narrator "Then morning comes."
    narrator "Lalu pagi pun tiba kembali."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:168
translate indonesian ending_bittersweet_gardener_623c1190:

    # bram "OI, LEO! Quit daydreaming in the clover bed—Halda's pulling rye loaves out of Oven Two and Vespera made chicory that's actually drinkable!"
    bram "OI, LEO! Berhenti melamun di bedeng semanggi—Halda baru ngangkat roti gandum hangat dari tungku! Bawa menteganya kemari, si cungkring!"

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:169
translate indonesian ending_bittersweet_gardener_a6c8796a:

    # vespera "Ignore the horned slander, Gardener. Come on—that western salt-acre past my father's survey stake sprouted three new inches of green fescue overnight."
    vespera "Nggak usah didengerin teriakannya Bram, Pak Tukang Kebun. Ayo jalan—tanggul garam barat butuh pasak tembaga baru sebelum sore."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:171
translate indonesian ending_bittersweet_gardener_0c345da9:

    # narrator "I brush dark, living soil off my knees, sling Orin's worn copper spade over my shoulder, and walk down into town beside the people I chose."
    narrator "Kuseka tanah hitam gembur yang menempel di lututku, kusempangkan sekop tembaga Kakek Orin di pundak, lalu kulangkahkan kakiku keluar menyongsong mentari pagi."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:172
translate indonesian ending_bittersweet_gardener_212409cb:

    # narrator "I never became a legendary hero."
    narrator "Aku memang tak pernah menjadi pahlawan legendaris."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:173
translate indonesian ending_bittersweet_gardener_76307bd5:

    # narrator "I became a neighbor. And five miles west of Thornwick, where dead white salt stood for twenty years, the grass is growing back."
    narrator "Aku menjadi seorang tetangga yang baik. Dan delapan kilometer di barat Thornwick, tempat garam mati dulunya berkuasa... kini rumput hijau tumbuh subur kembali."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:192
translate indonesian ending_tragic_pillar_e0ae22c1:

    # narrator "No more shaking knees. No more being small, ordinary, forgettable Leo Sato."
    narrator "Cukup sudah lutut yang gemetar. Cukup sudah menjadi sosok yang kerdil, biasa saja, dan mudah dilupakan orang."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:193
translate indonesian ending_tragic_pillar_2828417a:

    # narrator "Letting Master Orin's wooden spade clatter onto the rock, I step straight across the threshold into the roaring golden heart of the Crucible of Crowns."
    narrator "Kubiarkan sekop kayu Kakek Orin jatuh berdenting ke batu, lalu kulangkahkan kakiku langsung menuju lingkaran api emas Kawah Mahkota."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:195
translate indonesian ending_tragic_pillar_8f3f68a5:

    # vespera "LEO! GRAB MY HAND—GET OUT OF THE RING!"
    vespera "LEO! RAIH TANGANKU—KELUAR DARI LINGKARAN ITU SEKARANG JUGA!"

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:197
translate indonesian ending_tragic_pillar_2d6e6046:

    # narrator "For ten glorious, intoxicating seconds, my nine-year-old dream comes completely true."
    narrator "Selama sepuluh detik yang begitu memabukkan dan agung, mimpi masa kecilku saat berusia sembilan tahun akhirnya terkabul."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:198
translate indonesian ending_tragic_pillar_f1c0dfdf:

    # narrator "Blinding celestial armor weaves itself across my shoulders! Strength beyond every ballad floods my veins! Down along the Bastion cliffs, three thousand Ashen Vigil soldiers drop to their knees in awe as a single sweep of my radiant hand vaporizes the entire Hollow Tide from horizon to horizon!"
    narrator "Baju zirah selestial yang menyilaukan terajut menutupi pundakku! Kekuatan fisik: seratus. Resonansi Bela Diri: mutlak. Rasa sakit di punggungku lenyap seketika."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:200
translate indonesian ending_tragic_pillar_0eeb79a2:

    # thought "Look at me, Marcus. Look at me, everybody. Nobody can ever laugh at me again."
    thought "Lihat aku sekarang, Marcus. Lihat aku, semuanya. Sekarang nggak bakal ada lagi yang berani menertawakanku seumur hidup."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:201
translate indonesian ending_tragic_pillar_5532d953:

    # thought "...Wait. Who was Marcus?"
    thought "...Tunggu dulu. Marcus itu siapa ya?..."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:206
translate indonesian ending_tragic_pillar_91167c88:

    # narrator "Something warm slips out of my chest like sand through torn pockets."
    narrator "Sesuatu yang hangat mengalir keluar dari dadaku bagai pasir yang bocor dari saku robek."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:207
translate indonesian ending_tragic_pillar_743c4a1f:

    # thought "Wait—Apartment 4B. No, 4... something. There was a girl with scarred wrists shouting my name. What was her name? Vespera? Why is she crying?"
    thought "Tunggu sebentar—Apartemen 4B. Bukan, 4... apa tadi ya? Ada seorang gadis bermantel gelap dengan bekas luka di pergelangan tangannya... namanya siapa ya?..."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:211
translate indonesian ending_tragic_pillar_4ae93721:

    # leo "FEAR NOT, CITIZENS OF CINDERVALE. THE DELIVERANCE IS COMPLETE."
    leo "JANGAN TAKUT, WAHAI RAKYAT CINDERVALE. PENYELAMATAN KALIAN TELAH SEMPURNA."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:212
translate indonesian ending_tragic_pillar_503adacf:

    # thought "That wasn't my voice. Wait—what did grass smell like? Mom? Hold on, please, give me back just one—"
    thought "Itu bukan suaraku. Tunggu—aroma rumput basah itu seperti apa ya? Ibu? Tunggu dulu..."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:223
translate indonesian ending_tragic_pillar_ca843bfc:

    # narrator "Northern Cindervale is saved."
    narrator "Wilayah utara Cindervale akhirnya terselamatkan."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:224
translate indonesian ending_tragic_pillar_609f6cee:

    # narrator "Where the Hollow Seam once tore the sky stands a two-hundred-foot monument of silent, radiant white salt-crystal—armored, winged, flawless, and utterly still."
    narrator "Di tempat Celah Hampa dulunya mengoyak langit, kini berdiri sebuah tugu pilar kristal putih setinggi enam puluh meter—monumen abadi bagi Sang Paragon Ketujuh."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:225
translate indonesian ending_tragic_pillar_9b26d796:

    # narrator "Every spring, Concordat pilgrims lay gilded wreaths at its base and sing hymns to the Glorious Seventh Paragon."
    narrator "Tiap musim semi, para peziarah Konkordat meletakkan karangan bunga berlapis emas di kakinya dan melantunkan himne pemujaan."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:226
translate indonesian ending_tragic_pillar_0e4580bb:

    # narrator "Only Vespera Kael comes alone in the rain, setting an old taped-together paper notebook and a cheap brass laundry token against the cold crystal heel of a statue that can no longer hear her."
    narrator "Hanya Vespera Kael yang selalu datang sendirian di tengah dinginnya hujan, meletakkan sebuah buku gambar usang penuh selotip di atas tumpukan karangan bunga emas itu."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:228
translate indonesian ending_tragic_pillar_d89e7dba:

    # vespera "...Told you not to breathe through your mouth, idiot."
    vespera "...Kan sudah kubilang jangan bernapas lewat mulut, dasar bodoh..."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:244
translate indonesian ending_secret_two_doors_0b29065f:

    # leo "Vespera—clip all three First-Era Clovers into the outer ring! Orin, open the Conservatory sluice! Bram, Sera, Marshal—ON ME!"
    leo "Vespera—pasang ketiga Semanggi Era Pertama ke cincin luar astrolab! Resonansi Konservatori Orin cocok dengan batuan dasar menara ini! Tancapkan bersama-sama!"

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:245
translate indonesian ending_secret_two_doors_6119dd18:

    # narrator "Instead of shattering the sky or demanding a martyr, E. Marrow's four-hundred-year-old botanical cipher sings through the copper array in a warm emerald wave!"
    narrator "Bukannya menghancurkan langit atau menuntut korban jiwa seorang pahlawan, Pintas Dua-Akar rancangan E. Marrow menyerap pusaran energi Kawah secara lembut ke dalam tanah!"

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:246
translate indonesian ending_secret_two_doors_6ca6a7ba:

    # narrator "Across the summit, the predatory Choir Summoning Engine cracks down its golden spine—dissolving forever so no lonely daydreamer on Earth can ever be harvested as fuel again—while the stolen Verdance pours back down the mountainside like warm spring rain!"
    narrator "Di pelataran puncak, Mesin Pemanggil Konkordat yang memangsa jiwa retak berkeping-keping menjadi serpihan tembaga bisu."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:261
translate indonesian ending_secret_two_doors_1ae853e9:

    # narrator "Along the salt-cliffs of Thornwick, masons freeze in disbelief as pale green shoots of wild clover push up through twenty-year-old white crust."
    narrator "Di sepanjang tebing garam Thornwick, para tukang batu terkesiap tak percaya saat debu-debu garam di jalanan mencair menjadi tetesan embun segar dan tanah hitam yang subur!"

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:262
translate indonesian ending_secret_two_doors_611f4e35:

    # cassian "...Four centuries of war, ended with copper drainage wire and three weeds. Master Orin—the Ashen Vigil is hereby transferring its charter to agricultural reconstruction."
    cassian "...Empat abad peperangan yang tiada akhir, dituntaskan hanya dengan kawat tembaga saluran air dan tiga helai semanggi taman biasa."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:263
translate indonesian ending_secret_two_doors_be6144b9:

    # bram "WHICH MEANS YOU'RE ALL EATING MY GARLIC BARLEY STEW TONIGHT BEFORE YOU GO HOME!"
    bram "YANG ARTINYA MALAM INI KALIAN SEMUA WAJIB MAKAN SUP JELAI BAWANG PUTIHKU SAMPAI KENYANG SEBELUM CELEBRASI PULANG!"

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:265
translate indonesian ending_secret_two_doors_bf4f9cc6:

    # narrator "Because the Twin-Root Bypass harmonized gently with Master Orin's Conservatory, nobody gets left behind: both Seraphina and I walk calmly through the warm cedar-framed seam the next morning—carrying all our memories, and leaving behind a tiny six-inch 'Postbox Seam' beneath Orin's potting bench."
    narrator "Karena Pintas Dua-Akar selaras sempurna dengan padang rumput Konservatori Kakek Orin, dua pintu kepulangan beraroma hujan segar terbuka berdampingan: satu menuju Chicago, satu lagi menuju stasiun Eastside."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:275
translate indonesian ending_secret_two_doors_cbd7c133:

    # narrator "Six months later. Saturday, 7:30 AM. Eastside Community Garden, Earth."
    narrator "Enam bulan kemudian. Sabtu pagi, jam 07.30. Kebun Komunitas Warga Eastside."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:276
translate indonesian ending_secret_two_doors_b8859d94:

    # narrator "I still get nervous before phone interviews. My left knee still clicks on stairs. Last month I stuttered asking the hardware-store guy where the trowels were—and survived."
    narrator "Aku masih sering gugup kalau mau wawancara kerja lewat telepon. Lutut kiriku masih suka berbunyi 'krek' kalau kedinginan. Tapi sekarang aku punya kartu perpustakaan, tanaman tomat di jendela, dan sepatu ketsku selalu belepotan tanah gembur."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:278
translate indonesian ending_secret_two_doors_bb09e536:

    # sera "Unbelievable, Sato. I take an early train all the way from campus with real lemon scones my mom baked, and you've already got potting soil on your glasses."
    sera "Nggak bisa dipercaya deh, Sato. Aku sengaja naik kereta pagi-pagi dari kampus, dan kau malah asyik nyiram kubis pakai celana belel begitu."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:279
translate indonesian ending_secret_two_doors_3372c4f9:

    # leo "Hey, respect the uniform, Sera. Check underneath the third terracotta pot by the rosemary bed."
    leo "Hei, hargai seragam kerja ini dong, Sera. Coba periksa di bawah petak teras ketiga."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:281
translate indonesian ending_secret_two_doors_a872f266:

    # narrator "Beside a thriving patch of white three-leaf clover sits a small waxed-parchment envelope smelling faintly of toasted cumin and silver-solder:"
    narrator "Di samping rumpun semanggi putih berdaun tiga yang tumbuh subur, terselip sebuah botol kaca kedap air berisi selembar surat bertinta ungu yang beraroma teh jelai hangat:"

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:282
translate indonesian ending_secret_two_doors_b48cecf4:

    # narrator "{i}'Question-Mark & Starlight: Ditch B passed inspection. Twenty acres of Oakhaven grew real apple blossoms this week. Bram says peel your garlic properly, and Orin says step outside before noon. — V.K.'{/i}"
    narrator "{i}'Si Tanda Tanya & Bintang: Parit B lulus inspeksi kota. Dua puluh hektar kebun apel mekar kembali musim semi ini. Kakek Orin kirim salam hangat, dan Bram titip pesan suruh makan yang banyak.' — Vespera.{/i}"

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:287
translate indonesian ending_secret_two_doors_7bdca79e:

    # narrator "I kick off my canvas sneakers beside the wooden bench, step barefoot into the cool morning grass, and breathe in the smell of wet earth, coffee, and ordinary sunlight."
    narrator "Kulepaskan sepatu kets kanvasku di samping bangku kayu taman, lalu kulangkahkan kakiku yang telanjang langsung ke atas rumput hijau yang basah oleh sejuknya embun pagi."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:288
translate indonesian ending_secret_two_doors_030933e7:

    # narrator "Childhood me wanted a magic world because the real one hurt too much."
    narrator "Diriku saat masih kecil dulu mendambakan dunia sihir karena dunia nyata terasa begitu menyakitkan untuk dijalani."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:289
translate indonesian ending_secret_two_doors_320ecad0:

    # narrator "Adult me knows a better secret: the real world isn't finished yet—and you don't need a legendary sword to show up for it."
    narrator "Namun diriku yang dewasa kini memahami sebuah rahasia yang jauh lebih indah: dunia nyata ini belum selesai dibentuk. Dan ada rumput hijau yang harum menunggu untuk disentuh."

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:305
translate indonesian final_window_reflection_d3e08eb8:

    # centered "{color=#ebb963}{font=fonts/LiberationSerif-Bold.ttf}{size=28}[ending_banner_text!t]{/size}{/font}{/color}"
    centered "{color=#ebb963}{font=fonts/LiberationSerif-Bold.ttf}{size=28}[ending_title!t]{/size}{/font}{/color}"

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:307
translate indonesian final_window_reflection_0d6daae6:

    # centered "{color=#cbd8e2}{size=21}Thank you for playing {i}Where the Grass Still Grows{/i}.{/size}{/color}"
    centered "{color=#cbd8e2}{size=21}Terima kasih telah memainkan {i}Where the Grass Still Grows{/i}.{/size}{/color}"

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:308
translate indonesian final_window_reflection_054befd9:

    # centered "{color=#9eb4c4}{size=19}Before starting another route—or moving on to your next tab—\ntake ten quiet seconds.{/size}{/color}"
    centered "{color=#9eb4c4}{size=19}Sebelum memulai rute baru—atau melanjutkan harimu—luangkanlah waktu sejenak.{/size}{/color}"

# game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:309
translate indonesian final_window_reflection_9ffc1e31:

    # centered "{color=#7ec876}{font=fonts/LiberationSerif-Italic.ttf}{size=22}Look out your window.\nDrink a glass of water.\nThere is still a real world waiting outside for you.{/size}{/font}{/color}"
    centered "{color=#7ec876}{font=fonts/LiberationSerif-Italic.ttf}{size=22}Tengoklah ke luar jendelamu. Masih ada dunia nyata yang sedang menunggumu.{/size}{/font}{/color}"

translate indonesian strings:

    # game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:37
    old "{font=fonts/DejaVuSans.ttf}★{/font} (Secret True Path) Harmonize all 3 Forgotten Clovers & the Calibrated Astrolabe: Dismantle the Engine and open the Twin-Root Doors!"
    new "{font=fonts/DejaVuSans.ttf}★{/font} (Jalur Rahasia Sejati) Selaraskan ketiga Semanggi Terlupakan & Astrolab Terkalibrasi: Bongkar Mesin Pemanggil dan buka Pintu Dua-Akar!"

    # game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:40
    old "(Hopeful Path) Drive the copper spade into bedrock with everyone together—then take Vespera's Recall home to live my real life!"
    new "(Jalur Penuh Harapan) Hunjamkan sekop tembaga ke batuan dasar bersama-sama—lalu gunakan Pemulangan Vespera pulang untuk menjalani hidup nyataku!"

    # game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:43
    old "(Bittersweet Path) Clip my brass Earth-anchor onto Seraphina's coat so she makes it home to her mom—and stay behind in Solvara to help rebuild."
    new "(Jalur Pahit-Manis) Sematkan koin jangkar Bumi milikku ke mantel Seraphina agar ia pulang ke ibunya—dan tinggallah di Solvara membantu membangun kembali."

    # game/story/chapter5_endings.rpy:46
    old "(Tragic Temptation) Let go of the spade and step into the Crucible's golden fire—become the invincible Seventh Hero so no threat ever touches them again."
    new "(Godaan Tragis) Lepaskan sekop dan melangkahlah ke kobaran api emas Kawah—jadilah Pahlawan Ketujuh yang tak terkalahkan agar marabahaya tak menyentuh mereka lagi."
